abstract: >-
  ESMCHalo is a frozen protein-sequence predictor that combines ESMC-600M
  layer-36 canonical mean representations with five compact student heads
  trained using out-of-fold teacher targets with documented cross-fold limitations. The release
  provides frozen inference code, model checkpoints, calibration, a fixed
  threshold, verification utilities and locked evaluation summaries.
